      "message": "feat(app): MCP detect_holes, through the app's own Detect holes rule\n\nDrill, Bore and Thread machine only the holes in their parameters,\nwhich only the UI's Detect holes button could fill, so over MCP they\nalways refused (#312). The rule moves into operation::detect_holes;\nthe button and a new MCP tool detect_holes both call it and commit one\nundoable parameter edit.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
